//ttu.campuslabs.com/engage/organization/tech-choirs","website":null,"social":{},"email":null},{"name":"Tech Classical Society","key":"tech-classical-society","categories":["SGA Funded","Cultural/International","Academic: Arts & Sciences","Hobby/Leisure/Recreation"],"summary":"A society promoting knowledge of the Ancient Mediterranean.","about":"A society promoting knowledge of the Ancient Mediterranean.","join":null,"dues":null,"opportunities":null,"url":"https://ttu.campuslabs.com/engage/organization/tech-classical-society","website":"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0?cid=dGVjaGNsYXNzaWNhbG9mZmljZXJzQGdtYWlsLmNvbQ","social":{"linktree":"https://linktr.ee/TechClassicalSociety","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/techclassicalsociety/"},"email":null},{"name":"Tech Climbing Club","key":"tech-climbing-club","categories":["Sport Clubs"],"summary":"We strive to provide a friendly community for climbers at Texas Tech.","about":"Tech Climbing Club creates a fun and vibrant atmosphere for local climbers at the Tech climbing wall. In unison, the\r\n Tech Climbing Club will serve as a training resource for competitive climbers who are looking to go to collegiate competitions.","join":null,"dues":null,"opportunities":"In unison, the\r  Tech Climbing Club will serve as a training resource for competitive climbers who are looking to go to collegiate competitions.","url":"https://ttu.campuslabs.com/engage/organization/tech-climbing-club","website":null,"social":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/tech_climbing_club/"},"email":null},{"name":"Tech Club Baseball","key":"tech-club-baseball","categories":["Sport Clubs"],"summary":"We are a competitive collegiate baseball club designed to compete in the NCBA (National Club Baseball Association). To join the team, perspective players must tryout and then pay dues. Visit our Twitter for all information about tryouts @TTUclubBSB","about":"We are a competitive collegiate baseball club designed to compete in the NCBA (National Club Baseball Association). To join the team, perspective players must tryout and then pay dues. We compete in the Gulf Coast North Conference.\n For information about tryouts and addition information, please visit our Twitter page @TTUclubBSB","join":"To join the team, perspective players must tryout and then pay dues. For information about tryouts and addition information, please visit our Twitter page @TTUclubBSB","dues":"To join the team, perspective players must tryout and then pay dues.","opportunities":"We are a competitive collegiate baseball club designed to compete in the NCBA (National Club Baseball Association). We compete in the Gulf Coast North Conference.","url":"https://ttu.campuslabs.com/engage/organization/tech-club-baseball","website":null,"social":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/ttu.clubbaseball/"},"email":null},{"name":"Tech Club Hockey","key":"tech-ice-hockey","categories":["Sport Clubs","Hobby/Leisure/Recreation"],"summary":"Tech Ice Hockey is a club for hockey players that want to continue playing competitive hockey. The club competes in the American Collegiate Hockey Association, which abides by the same rules and regulations as the NCAA. The ACHA has a Regional tourname...","about":"Tech Ice Hockey is a club for hockey players that want to continue playing competitive hockey. The club competes in the American Collegiate Hockey Association, which abides by the same rules and regulations as the NCAA. The ACHA has a Regional tournament,\r\n National tournament, and is taken very seriously throughout the nation.","join":null,"dues":null,"opportunities":"Tech Ice Hockey is a club for hockey players that want to continue playing competitive hockey. The ACHA has a Regional tournament,\r  National tournament, and is taken very seriously throughout the nation.","url":"https://ttu.campuslabs.com/engage/organization/tech-ice-hockey","website":"http://ttuhockey.com","social":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/ttu_ice_hockey/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/TechIceHockey/?ref=bookmarks"},"email":null},{"name":"Tech Club Water Polo Team","key":"ttuwaterpoloclub","categories":["Sport Clubs"],"summary":"We play water polo in the Collegiate Water Polo Association Men's Texas Division as a Co-Ed team. Our season takes place in the Fall but we continue to practice through the spring semester. We will resume practice in the Spring","about":"We play water polo in the Collegiate Water Polo Association Men's Texas Division as a Co-Ed team. Our season takes place in the Fall but we continue to practice through the spring semester. If you want to join the team please contact us, you are welcome to come try it out! We will resume practice in the Spring.","join":"If you want to join the team please contact us, you are welcome to come try it out!","dues":null,"opportunities":null,"url":"https://ttu.campuslabs.com/engage/organization/ttuwaterpoloclub","website":null,"social":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/ttuwaterpolo?igsh=cjlmYTd6Z2hlbWFh&utm_source=qr"},"email":null},{"name":"Tech College Republicans","key":"tech-college-republicans","categories":["Advocacy/Activism","Political"],"summary":"Tech College Republicans is an official auxiliary branch of the Republican Party of Texas and member of the Texas Federation of College Republicans. We actively promote the Republican Party and values at Tech. Join Us Today!","about":"Tech College Republicans is an official auxiliary branch of the Republican Party of Texas and member of the Texas Federation of College Republicans. We actively promote the Republican Party and values on campus. Additionally, our chapter works to support local, state, and national candidates. TCR is the largest College Republican chapter in the West Texas Region. Our members have represented Texas Tech College Republicans at state conventions, volunteered on campaigns throughout the country, interned in Washington D.C., and found jobs in the political realm. Whether you are a fiscal conservative, social conservative, neo-conservative, libertarian, or a moderate we encourage you to join this group and help create the next generation of Republican leaders. We welcome any Tech students politically interested or looking to find their political organization to attend a meeting and learn, or c","join":"Whether you are a fiscal conservative, social conservative, neo-conservative, libertarian, or a moderate we encourage you to join this group and help create the next generation of Republican leaders.","dues":null,"opportunities":"Our members have represented Texas Tech College Republicans at state conventions, volunteered on campaigns throughout the country, interned in Washington D.C., and found jobs in the political realm.","url":"https://ttu.campuslabs.com/engage/organization/tech-college-republicans","website":null,"social":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/techcollegerepublicans/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/techcollegerepublicans/","x":"http://twitter.com/twitter.com/ttechrepublican"},"email":null},{"name":"Tech Council on Family Relations","key":"tech-council-on-family-relations","categories":["Service/Philanthropy","Academic: Human Sciences","Pre-Professional","Advocacy/Activism"],"summary":"Tech CFR members and stakeholders work to fulfill the mission of the organization by providing information and networking sessions, regular meetings with guest speakers, service opportunities, and social events!In accordance with both the National Coun...","about":"Tech CFR members and stakeholders work to fulfill the mission of the organization by providing information and networking sessions, regular meetings with guest speakers, service opportunities, and social events! In accordance with both the National Council on Family Relations and Texas CFR, our mission is to provide an education forum for family researchers, educators, and practitioners to share in the development and dissemination of knowledge about families and family relationships, establish professional standards, and work to promote family well-being.","join":null,"dues":null,"opportunities":"Tech CFR members and stakeholders work to fulfill the mission of the organization by providing information and networking sessions, regular meetings with guest speakers, service opportunities, and social events!","url":"https://ttu.campuslabs.com/engage/organization/tech-council-on-family-relations","website":null,"social":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/tech.cfr/","x":"http://twitter.com/TechCFR"},"email":null},{"name":"Tech Creative Media Association","key":"tcma","categories":["Academic: Arts & Sciences","Academic: Business","Academic: Media & Communication","Academic: Visual & Performing Arts","Hobby/Leisure/Recreation"],"summary":"The Tech Creative Media Association is a group of like-minded content creators. TCMA is a place of creative freedom for filmmakers, photographers, or other creative media makers that allows students to find assistance or networking opportunities.","about":"We wanted to create an organization that opens its arms to anyone at the university, no matter the major, and provide a group that enjoys film and television production. The organization itself has multiple focuses, including, but not limited to, film and television analysis, technique analysis, writing, graphic design, photography, animation, and overall production. TCMA allows content creators to gain valuable insight from each other, facilitates collaboration opportunities, and provides a place for other creatives to meet each other.\n TCMA, although not put together to be a production company, also allows members to have the opportunity to volunteer with other productions. The organization promotes the idea of self-production by showcasing the members' abilities and strengths and encouraging them to create their own original ideas. This not only includes the group analysis and comment","join":null,"dues":null,"opportunities":"TCMA allows content creators to gain valuable insight from each other, facilitates collaboration opportunities, and provides a place for other creatives to meet each other. TCMA, although not put together to be a production company, also allows members to have the opportunity to volunteer with other productions.","url":"https://ttu.campuslabs.com/engage/organization/tcma","website":"https://tcma.taplink.ws/","social":{"linktree":"https://linktr.ee/TechCMA","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/txtcma/","linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/groups/14079611/","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5KihW8Sv6EMZCgoodsw06w","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/TxTCMA/"},"email":null},{"name":"Tech Dairy Science Club","key":"techdairyscienceclub","categories":["Academic: Agricultural Sciences & Natural Resources"],"summary":"The purpose of our organization is to bring together Texas Tech students interested in dairy cattle or a career within the industry. We will hold monthly meetings, discuss dairy industry topics, participate in community events, and highlight the dairy in","about":"The purpose of our organization is to bring together Texas Tech students interested in dairy cattle or a career within the industry. We will hold monthly meetings, discuss dairy industry topics, participate in community events, and highlight the dairy industry positively.","join":null,"dues":null,"opportunities":"The purpose of our organization is to bring together Texas Tech students interested in dairy cattle or a career within the industry.","url":"https://ttu.campuslabs.com/engage/organization/techdairyscienceclub","website":null,"social":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/techdairyscienceclub/","facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100089544383537"},"email":null},{"name":"Tech Disc Golf","key":"tech-disc-golf","categories":["Sport Clubs","Hobby/Leisure/Recreation"],"summary":"Tech Disc Golf Club intends to teach new players the amazing sport of disc golf, while also creating a competitiv